        {
          "text": "Manase yagiye ku ngoma amaze imyaka cumi n’ibiri; ayimarakw imyaka mirongwitanu n’itanu ar’ i Yerusalemu; nyina yitwa Hefusiba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
