              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ ati Sinzosubira guturatuza Abisirayeli ngo bave mu gihugu nahaye ba sekuruza, ni bitondera ivyo nabageze vyose, n’ivyagezwe vyose umusavyi wanje Mose yabageze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yamara ntibaruha bavyumva; ariko Manase abakwegera mu bibi kuruta ivyo amahanga yakora, ayo Uhoraho yaranduye imbere y’Abisirayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.9"
            ]
