        {
          "text": "ati Manase umwami w’i Buyuda ko yakoze ivyo bizira vyose vy’ubuyobe, agakora ibibi kuruta ivyo Abamori bāmubanjirije bākoze vyose, agacumurisha Abayuda ibishushanyo vyiwe; ",
