        },
        {
          "text": "ni co gitumye jewe Uhoraho Imana y’Abisirayeli mvuze, nti Ngira ntēze i Yerusalemu n’i Buyuda ivyago bikomeye, bitume ūzovyumva wese iminzerere imuvuga mu matwi. ",
