              "text": "karisho n’akagozi karikw akabuye bageresha mu kwubaka nko mu buryo bga nivo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nageresheje inzu ya Ahabu; kandi nzohanagura Yerusalemu, nk’uk’ umuntu ahanagura isahani, agaheza akayubika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
