              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Manase yavishije amaraso menshi y’aberanda, araruha yuzuza Yerusalemu amaraso uhereye ku ruhande rumwe ugashitsa ku rundi; ivyo abigereka ku caha ciwe yakwegeyemw’ Abayuda, ngo bakore ivyo Uhoraho abona kw ari bibi.",
